	default n
	---help---
		Enable QSPI4.  On the a3g-tc4d7-lite board QSPI4 is wired
                to the SEMPER Flash / mikroBUS SPI header:
                MOSI=P22.0 (QSPI4_MTSR_F, ALT3),
                MISO=P22.1 (QSPI4_MRSTB_F, MRIS=1, input),
                SCLK=P22.3 (QSPI4_SCLK_F, ALT3),
                CS=SLSO6 (P23.1, ALT3).

